03:19:55,670 --> 03:19:56,110
Books...

3686
03:19:56,110 --> 03:19:57,310
And these can go here.

3687
03:19:59,450 --> 03:19:59,890
Uh...

3688
03:19:59,890 --> 03:20:00,750
Netherite ingots.

3689
03:20:00,990 --> 03:20:02,190
Five of them, by the way.

3690
03:20:03,210 --> 03:20:03,570
Nice.

3691
03:20:05,290 --> 03:20:06,030
Ender chest.

3692
03:20:06,910 --> 03:20:07,350
Uh...

3693
03:20:07,350 --> 03:20:07,530
Spruce...

3694
03:20:07,530 --> 03:20:08,530
Why do they have spruce logs on me?

3695
03:20:10,350 --> 03:20:12,930
Oh, I was chopping down trees outside, of course.

3696
03:20:13,670 --> 03:20:14,450
It makes sense.

3697
03:20:15,570 --> 03:20:16,450
Birch planks...

3698
03:20:16,450 --> 03:20:17,090
In here.

3699
03:20:20,580 --> 03:20:21,020
Yeah.

3700
03:20:21,280 --> 03:20:21,860
That's good.

3701
03:20:22,220 --> 03:20:23,180
This is also good.

3702
03:20:23,300 --> 03:20:24,480
Where's my crafting table, though?

3703
03:20:24,560 --> 03:20:25,920
Did I not...

3704
03:20:25,920 --> 03:20:26,580
Bring one?

3705
03:20:26,700 --> 03:20:28,260
I guess I forgot to bring it back.

3706
03:20:29,200 --> 03:20:30,120
Always carry this.

3707
03:20:30,820 --> 03:20:31,620
It's a good idea.

3708
03:20:33,200 --> 03:20:34,400
Also carry that as well.

3709
03:20:35,180 --> 03:20:36,260
Can I put this in here?

3710
03:20:36,500 --> 03:20:36,860
Oh!

3711
03:20:38,680 --> 03:20:39,980
Oh my god!

3712
03:20:42,500 --> 03:20:43,020
Dude!

3713
03:20:43,340 --> 03:20:44,420
That's even crazier.

3714
03:20:45,180 --> 03:20:46,940
The Ender chest goes in here!

3715
03:20:51,140 --> 03:20:53,440
I heard you like pouches, dog.

3716
03:20:54,320 --> 03:20:59,860
So we put a pouch in your pouch, so you can pull out the pouch out of the pouch and access a remote pouch via that pouch.

3717
03:21:00,580 --> 03:21:01,500
Whenever you want.

3718
03:21:02,140 --> 03:21:03,020
That's amazing.

3719
03:21:03,020 --> 03:21:05,180
The bop goes back on the shelf.

3720
03:21:11,340 --> 03:21:11,860
There.

3721
03:21:12,420 --> 03:21:14,660
I'm actually starting to remember where I put my books.

3722
03:21:14,920 --> 03:21:16,460
This one is Book of Music.

3723
03:21:17,820 --> 03:21:18,340
Yep.

3724
03:21:18,660 --> 03:21:20,340
This one is...

3725
03:21:20,340 --> 03:21:20,560
I forgot.

3726
03:21:21,100 --> 03:21:21,780
Book of Brewing.

3727
03:21:21,900 --> 03:21:23,460
Okay, so bop is in the middle.

3728
03:21:24,000 --> 03:21:25,400
No, not you, bop!

3729
03:21:25,700 --> 03:21:27,060
Don't listen to what I'm saying!

3730
03:21:27,840 --> 03:21:29,760
And the one in the bottom right is...

3731
03:21:30,260 --> 03:21:31,840
Book of...

3732
03:21:34,280 --> 03:21:34,800
Goals.

3733
03:21:35,120 --> 03:21:35,760
Right, easy.

3734
03:21:36,560 --> 03:21:37,080
Fundamentals.

3735
03:21:37,960 --> 03:21:38,260
Music.

3736
03:21:38,840 --> 03:21:39,140
Brewing.

3737
03:21:39,280 --> 03:21:39,620
Okay, good.

3738
03:21:40,120 --> 03:21:41,140
I will remember this.

3739
03:21:41,840 --> 03:21:42,840
We got some pork chops.

3740
03:21:43,020 --> 03:21:43,560
We got some of this.

3741
03:21:44,020 --> 03:21:45,280
Okay, what's the next thing I want to do?

3742
03:21:46,560 --> 03:21:46,860
Um...

3743
03:21:47,700 --> 03:21:48,840
How do I make the maze?

3744
03:21:49,080 --> 03:21:49,480
Damn it!

3745
03:21:51,220 --> 03:21:52,940
He- Okay, I need heavy core, I guess.

3746
03:21:53,060 --> 03:21:53,900
That's how I make the maze.

3747
03:21:54,920 --> 03:21:56,100
How do I get the heavy core?

3748
03:21:56,360 --> 03:21:56,760
Damn it!

3749
03:21:59,620 --> 03:22:00,060
Fuck!

3750
03:22:00,320 --> 03:22:00,640
Look at...

3751
03:22:00,640 --> 03:22:02,240
Why is it colored like that, by the way?

3752
03:22:03,300 --> 03:22:05,480
Very few items in the game have that color.

3753
03:22:07,840 --> 03:22:09,120
It's gotta mean...

3754
03:22:09,120 --> 03:22:10,780
It's a really rare drop, maybe?

3755
03:22:10,800 --> 03:22:12,780
It's like a legendary item?

3756
03:22:13,720 --> 03:22:14,560
Something like that.

3757
03:22:15,860 --> 03:22:17,380
Uh, I kinda need to repair my gears.

3758
03:22:17,860 --> 03:22:18,680
My gear here.

3759
03:22:18,760 --> 03:22:19,620
It's falling apart.

3760
03:22:20,600 --> 03:22:21,860
Uh, let's do that now.

3761
03:22:22,680 --> 03:22:23,580
Repair the gear.

3762
03:22:36,390 --> 03:22:37,410
No, not that one.

3763
03:22:37,550 --> 03:22:37,830
This one.

3764
03:22:42,960 --> 03:22:43,480
Yep!

3765
03:22:45,240 --> 03:22:45,760
Lovely!

3766
03:22:45,760 --> 03:22:46,480
Look at that.

3767
03:22:47,600 --> 03:22:47,840
Ah!

3768
03:22:48,440 --> 03:22:49,340
Fully repaired.

3769
03:22:49,800 --> 03:22:50,660
The shield?

3770
03:22:51,260 --> 03:22:53,480
Uh, it's much better to just craft a new one.

3771
03:22:53,760 --> 03:22:54,780
When it comes to that.

3772
03:22:55,720 --> 03:22:56,240
Nice!

3773
03:22:58,520 --> 03:22:59,900
Kinda wanna upgrade Bob!

3774
03:23:00,700 --> 03:23:01,220
Bob?

3775
03:23:07,000 --> 03:23:08,300
Why is Bob not at home?

3776
03:23:08,840 --> 03:23:10,500
Oh wait, Bob is...

3777
03:23:11,080 --> 03:23:11,480
No.

3778
03:23:11,860 --> 03:23:13,660
I thought the enchanting table was Bob.

3779
03:23:17,090 --> 03:23:18,150
ODB is up there.

3780
03:23:20,450 --> 03:23:20,850
Bob?

3781
03:23:34,830 --> 03:23:35,610
Let me go to sleep.

3782
03:23:44,400 --> 03:23:46,280
Hopefully I didn't leave a wall open or something.

3783
03:23:51,430 --> 03:23:53,510
At some point I should be able to hear his...

3784
03:23:53,510 --> 03:23:53,650
Huh?

3785
03:23:57,320 --> 03:23:58,780
Wait a minute, is this a security risk?

3786
03:24:01,800 --> 03:24:02,520
This tree?

3787
03:24:05,900 --> 03:24:06,500
Maybe...

3788
03:24:06,500 --> 03:24:08,460
No, that was just a pig.

3789
03:24:11,450 --> 03:24:12,050
Bob?

3790
03:24:12,470 --> 03:24:13,090
Wait a minute.

3791
03:24:14,230 --> 03:24:15,030
Oh no.

3792
03:24:15,710 --> 03:24:16,230
Bob?

3793
03:24:21,130 --> 03:24:22,870
Did you just give me this?

3794
03:24:23,710 --> 03:24:24,170
Huh.

3795
03:24:29,170 --> 03:24:29,510
Thanks.

3796
03:24:30,290 --> 03:24:31,410
Did Bob go in here?

3797
03:24:32,710 --> 03:24:33,610
Oh no.

3798
03:24:33,850 --> 03:24:34,150
Bob!

3799
03:24:44,560 --> 03:24:45,560
I don't think he did.

3800
03:24:56,760 --> 03:24:57,920
Bob, where are you?

3801
03:25:00,120 --> 03:25:01,440
He can't have gone far.

3802
03:25:05,720 --> 03:25:07,400
Maybe he has a way to get out?

3803
03:25:14,770 --> 03:25:15,990
Could he get on this roof?

3804
03:25:18,540 --> 03:25:18,820
Good.

3805
03:25:19,340 --> 03:25:20,720
He could technically get up here.

3806
03:25:20,900 --> 03:25:22,160
And walk along here.

3807
03:25:23,120 --> 03:25:23,920
Onto here.

3808
03:25:24,100 --> 03:25:25,060
And jump out.

3809
03:25:28,890 --> 03:25:30,050
Oh no.

3810
03:25:40,240 --> 03:25:40,880
Right?

3811
03:25:41,840 --> 03:25:43,240
That's totally possible.

3812
03:25:44,760 --> 03:25:45,960
Are you kidding me?

3813
03:25:46,060 --> 03:25:47,220
Why did he do that?

3814
03:25:49,280 --> 03:25:49,920
Bob!

3815
03:25:52,420 --> 03:25:54,180
What, you don't like it here or what?

3816
03:25:55,360 --> 03:25:56,400
What's the problem?

3817
03:26:05,920 --> 03:26:07,700
I'm trying to sense Bob.

3818
03:26:11,480 --> 03:26:13,120
Bob is not present.

3819
03:26:14,500 --> 03:26:15,560
He is not here.

3820
03:26:16,440 --> 03:26:16,920
Fuck!

3821
03:26:18,300 --> 03:26:20,820
Bob locator 3000 cannot even find him.

3822
03:26:20,940 --> 03:26:21,260
He's gone.

3823
03:26:22,720 --> 03:26:24,080
Bro, I'm losing my mind.

3824
03:26:24,280 --> 03:26:25,240
Over these villagers.

3825
03:26:25,620 --> 03:26:26,200
Just...

3826
03:26:26,200 --> 03:26:26,740
Leaving!

3827
03:26:26,980 --> 03:26:27,660
Or disappearing!

3828
03:26:28,900 --> 03:26:32,180
We may have a serial killer in our midst here.

3829
03:26:32,800 --> 03:26:34,160
Everyone is disappearing.

3830
03:26:34,160 --> 03:26:34,480
This...

3831
03:26:34,480 --> 03:26:36,080
This tree is a security risk.

3832
03:26:38,520 --> 03:26:39,360
Get it out of here.

3833
03:26:44,030 --> 03:26:46,110
The only one I can trust right now is ODB.

3834
03:26:47,330 --> 03:26:48,530
ODB is a real one.

3835
03:26:48,930 --> 03:26:50,030
Bob was a faker.

3836
03:26:50,270 --> 03:26:50,490
Wait!

3837
03:27:07,060 --> 03:27:07,900
He's not here.

3838
03:27:24,340 --> 03:27:25,760
I can't stop looking at it.

3839
03:27:27,740 --> 03:27:28,560
Oh man.

3840
03:27:28,780 --> 03:27:29,480
So good.

3841
03:27:30,360 --> 03:27:32,480
In fact, I was so sad about losing Bob.

3842
03:27:32,760 --> 03:27:34,880
Now that I saw that in action, I'm happy again.

3843
03:27:35,860 --> 03:27:36,320
Yeah.

3844
03:27:38,240 --> 03:27:38,920
Everything's fine.

3845
03:27:39,360 --> 03:27:41,600
I have a feeling Bob may have gone through these doors.

3846
03:27:44,650 --> 03:27:45,830
We gotta fix this.

3847
03:27:50,830 --> 03:27:51,490
But wait.

3848
03:27:53,130 --> 03:27:54,250
I can't get out again.

3849
03:27:54,510 --> 03:27:55,410
We need a button.

3850
03:27:58,470 --> 03:27:59,630
It's button time!

3851
03:28:02,010 --> 03:28:03,130
Do I even have any?

3852
03:28:03,650 --> 03:28:04,150
Shit.

3853
03:28:06,070 --> 03:28:07,070
Button requires...

3854
03:28:07,070 --> 03:28:07,590
A stone!

3855
03:28:07,770 --> 03:28:08,790
I definitely have that.

3856
03:28:17,440 --> 03:28:18,780
Can I blast it?

3857
03:28:19,320 --> 03:28:20,340
I can't.

3858
03:28:20,800 --> 03:28:21,240
Shit.

3859
03:28:23,850 --> 03:28:25,270
Be quick about your business.

3860
03:28:27,800 --> 03:28:28,330
Thank you.

3861
03:28:40,050 --> 03:28:41,230
Uh, button first.

3862
03:28:45,150 --> 03:28:46,320
And then...

3863
03:28:48,100 --> 03:28:48,740
Oh no!

3864
03:28:48,860 --> 03:28:49,280
That doesn't work.

3865
03:28:49,600 --> 03:28:49,820
What?

3866
03:28:52,140 --> 03:28:52,580
Oh!

3867
03:28:52,980 --> 03:28:53,360
Here?

3868
03:28:53,660 --> 03:28:54,280
Does that work?

3869
03:28:56,950 --> 03:28:57,370
No!

3870
03:28:59,010 --> 03:28:59,690
There we go.

3871
03:29:00,270 --> 03:29:01,630
So now...

3872
03:29:01,630 --> 03:29:02,130
Hey!

3873
03:29:03,030 --> 03:29:04,270
Oh, that was kinda close.

3874
03:29:04,870 --> 03:29:05,630
That works!

3875
03:29:06,150 --> 03:29:06,650
You know what?

3876
03:29:06,710 --> 03:29:08,590
Maybe Bob followed me up here last time I opened these doors.

3877
03:29:08,690 --> 03:29:09,290
Maybe he was sneaky.

3878
03:29:12,990 --> 03:29:13,770
Hey yo, Bob!

3879
03:29:16,170 --> 03:29:17,210
Are you up here?

3880
03:29:20,760 --> 03:29:21,840
Let's listen for Bob.

3881
03:29:25,060 --> 03:29:25,960
That's not Bob.

3882
03:29:26,400 --> 03:29:27,200
That's a cow.

3883
03:29:28,120 --> 03:29:29,080
What's up, cow?

3884
03:29:35,210 --> 03:29:37,330
I could scope out Bob from up here maybe.

3885
03:29:37,910 --> 03:29:39,450
He can't have gone far, right?

3886
03:29:54,160 --> 03:29:55,240
Where could he have gone?

3887
03:29:58,630 --> 03:30:01,050
I am actually considering going for a rescue mission.

3888
03:30:08,080 --> 03:30:09,420
Not seeing him.

3889
03:30:18,340 --> 03:30:19,260
Is he down there?

3890
03:30:19,780 --> 03:30:20,420
Did he...

3891
03:30:20,420 --> 03:30:22,720
Did he fall in the cave in the middle of the...

3892
03:30:23,280 --> 03:30:23,680
village?

3893
03:30:24,880 --> 03:30:26,320
I feel like I would've heard him.

3894
03:30:26,520 --> 03:30:27,880
He does make sounds, doesn't he?

3895
03:30:29,720 --> 03:30:31,360
Wait, where was he last time?

3896
03:30:31,680 --> 03:30:32,700
Oh no, I can't get out.

3897
03:30:34,680 --> 03:30:36,440
I need a button on the other side of these doors.

3898
03:30:39,910 --> 03:30:40,310
ODB!

3899
03:30:41,050 --> 03:30:41,790
How you doing?

3900
03:30:42,010 --> 03:30:42,410
High five!

3901
03:30:43,490 --> 03:30:43,890
Nice.

3902
03:30:47,690 --> 03:30:50,050
I should've left Bob in here with the pigs!

3903
03:30:50,530 --> 03:30:51,910
Why did I release him?

3904
03:30:52,850 --> 03:30:55,630
I should've left him there in the pig pen.

3905
03:30:58,210 --> 03:30:59,870
He could've gone along here, I think.

3906
03:31:01,190 --> 03:31:02,290
Security risk detected.

3907
03:31:04,670 --> 03:31:05,170
Bob!

3908
03:31:13,610 --> 03:31:14,650
Maybe he went down here.

3909
03:31:18,880 --> 03:31:19,940
No, that's a dead end.

3910
03:31:21,700 --> 03:31:22,200
Fuck!

3911
03:31:22,500 --> 03:31:23,240
I don't wanna lose...

3912
03:31:23,240 --> 03:31:24,280
Dude, he was important.

3913
03:31:24,500 --> 03:31:25,600
He had mending on him.

3914
03:31:28,120 --> 03:31:29,640
This is actually a tragedy!

3915
03:31:34,700 --> 03:31:35,060
Unreal.

3916
03:31:37,880 --> 03:31:38,800
I thought I...

3917
03:31:39,200 --> 03:31:40,240
foolproofed the entire village.

3918
03:31:40,600 --> 03:31:41,200
Maybe he's over here.

3919
03:31:47,040 --> 03:31:49,880
What if I just go to bed and wake up and hope everything was a bad dream?

3920
03:31:50,680 --> 03:31:51,800
And Bob will be back.

3921
03:32:00,820 --> 03:32:01,180
Okay.

3922
03:32:01,480 --> 03:32:02,220
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

3923
03:32:02,220 --> 03:32:02,720
Oh!

3924
03:32:02,860 --> 03:32:02,960
Oh!

3925
03:32:08,080 --> 03:32:08,640
Oh, no, wait.

3926
03:32:08,700 --> 03:32:09,560
That just leads back down here.

3927
03:32:09,660 --> 03:32:09,920
Of course.

3928
03:32:12,480 --> 03:32:14,320
I really should close this hole, actually.

3929
03:32:16,220 --> 03:32:17,260
We can't have this.

3930
03:32:20,900 --> 03:32:22,220
This is bad, bad, bad.

3931
03:32:23,380 --> 03:32:23,920
Very bad.

3932
03:32:26,660 --> 03:32:27,400
Give me some dirt.

3933
03:32:30,280 --> 03:32:31,740
That hole needs to be closed.

3934
03:32:31,740 --> 03:32:33,580
Everything needs to be super safe and secure.

3935
03:32:42,450 --> 03:32:42,890
Nice!

3936
03:32:43,130 --> 03:32:43,250
Okay.

3937
03:32:43,650 --> 03:32:44,390
One security risk.

3938
03:32:44,610 --> 03:32:44,750
Less.

3939
03:32:48,470 --> 03:32:49,350
How else...

3940
03:32:49,350 --> 03:32:49,490
Okay.

3941
03:32:49,650 --> 03:32:50,790
How could he have escaped?

3942
03:32:54,530 --> 03:32:55,390
Maybe this tree.

3943
03:32:56,910 --> 03:32:57,750
I don't know how.

3944
03:33:05,310 --> 03:33:06,690
This tree needs to go as well.

3945
03:33:06,710 --> 03:33:08,410
In case he somehow gets on the roof.

3946
03:33:09,350 --> 03:33:10,330
I don't know how.

3947
03:33:13,960 --> 03:33:17,040
The next villager that comes here needs to be taken care of.

3948
03:33:17,100 --> 03:33:18,060
We also need to fix this.

3949
03:33:19,280 --> 03:33:21,400
This needs to be, uh...

3950
03:33:22,300 --> 03:33:23,180
They can't...

3951
03:33:23,180 --> 03:33:24,120
They can't jump down there.

3952
03:33:24,340 --> 03:33:24,740
It's bad.

3953
03:33:24,940 --> 03:33:25,460
They could die.

3954
03:33:27,860 --> 03:33:31,380
I wonder if they are able to sort of jump across a gap or something.

3955
03:33:33,860 --> 03:33:35,060
Is this tree disappearing?

3956
03:33:37,540 --> 03:33:38,180
It is.

3957
03:33:38,360 --> 03:33:38,500
Good.

3958
03:33:41,280 --> 03:33:42,280
Okay, so...

3959
03:33:42,280 --> 03:33:43,820
This is all looking good.

3960
03:33:44,420 --> 03:33:45,460
Did I leave a...

3961
03:33:45,460 --> 03:33:46,360
Door open?

3962
03:33:46,740 --> 03:33:47,180
Nope.

3963
03:33:51,860 --> 03:33:53,600
Everything here looks to be in order.

3964
03:33:56,100 --> 03:33:58,500
These trees are potentially security risks.

3965
03:33:58,740 --> 03:33:59,420
Oh yeah, look at this.

3966
03:34:00,140 --> 03:34:04,120
He could have maybe gone along here, jumped up here and gone out this way.

3967
03:34:06,460 --> 03:34:07,260
They need to go.

3968
03:34:10,880 --> 03:34:12,260
This is a fucking disaster.

3969
03:34:12,540 --> 03:34:14,460
